<title>DUBAI: GOLF-DUBAI CREEK OPEN FINAL ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-DUBAI CREEK OPEN FINAL ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading final round scores in the </p>
<p>$350,000 Dubai Creek Open golf tournament on Friday:</p>
<p>280 Paul Friedlander (Swaziland) 69 70 69 72</p>
<p>284 Craig Kamps (South Africa) 68 75 71 70, Kyi Hla Han (Burma)</p>
<p>68 72 71 73</p>
<p>285 Robert Stephens (Australia) 73 70 71 71, Nam Young-woo</p>
<p>(South Korea) 72 72 70 71, Choi Kyung-ju (South Korea) 70 69</p>
<p>67 79</p>
<p>286 Jeev Milkha Singh (India) 71 68 75 72, Mo Joong-kyung</p>
<p>(South Korea) 71 73 68 74</p>
<p>287 Lee Joon-suk (South Korea) 76 71 69 71</p>
</text>
